@startuml

title ROSE Affective State Dynamics

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
    BorderColor #303030
    ArrowColor #202020
}

[*] --> AtBaseMood : ROBOT_AFFECTIVE_PROFILE received\ninitialize state = base mood

state "At Base Mood" as AtBaseMood {
    AtBaseMood : s_r = b
}

state "Holding Transformed\nAffective State" as Holding {
    Holding : s_r = s'_r
}

state "Returning to\nBase Mood" as Returning {
    Returning : s_r -> b
}

' ============================================================
' USER AFFECTIVE STATE EVENTS
' ============================================================

AtBaseMood --> Holding : USER_AFFECTIVE_STATE\n/ apply Empathic Transformation\n/ start decay delay

Holding --> Holding : USER_AFFECTIVE_STATE\n/ apply Empathic Transformation\n/ update s'_r\n/ restart decay delay

Returning --> Holding : USER_AFFECTIVE_STATE\n/ apply Empathic Transformation\n/ update s'_r\n/ restart decay delay

' ============================================================
' TEMPORAL DYNAMICS
' ============================================================

Holding --> Returning : decay delay elapsed\n/ enable Emotional Decay

Returning --> AtBaseMood : base mood reached

' ============================================================
' NOTES
' ============================================================

note right of Holding
The transformed affective state
is maintained during the
decay delay (l).

Emotional Decay is inhibited
during this interval.
end note

note right of Returning
Emotional Decay iteratively
updates s_r toward b.

Each intermediate state is
published as ROBOT_AFFECTIVE_STATE.
end note

note bottom of AtBaseMood
b represents the robot
base mood and affective
equilibrium point.
end note

@enduml